OL,3,GNEWSAArt by modern slavery survivors
OL,4,Ashown across city
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis article contains details that some
OL,7,Freaders may find distressing
OL,9,F"I'm not the person I was six months
OL,10,Fago. I'm a person full of possibility."
OL,12,FVictor - not his real name - is a
OL,13,Fsurvivor of modern day slavery.
OL,15,FHe is describing the impact of creating
OL,16,Fart in workshops organised by the
OL,17,Fcharity Hestia, which helps people who
OL,18,Fhave been trafficked to rebuild their
OL,19,Flives.
